# Materials Selection. Resources in Technology.

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
This learning activity develops algorithms to ensure that the process of selecting materials is well defined and sound. These procedures require the use of many databases to provide the designer with information such as physical, mechanical, and chemical properties of the materials under consideration. A design brief, student quiz, and five references are provided. (JOW)

**Source:** https://eric.ed.gov/?id=EJ425217

